[00:02.366]Lately I wanna stay awake
{"最近我只想保持清醒"}
[00:04.866]I don’t want the days to end
{"不愿让白昼就此终结"}
[00:09.866]I know you’ll fly away
{"明知你终将展翅远飞"}
[00:12.615]Need to hold you for myself
{"只想将你禁锢在怀中"}
[00:17.115]I feel the time run through my hands
{"感受时光从指缝流逝"}
[00:20.115]Try to grab it but it fades
{"竭力挽留却徒劳无功"}
[00:23.120]Say "goodbye" in all the possible ways
{"用尽所有方式道别离"}
[00:31.619]I don’t want you to get lost
{"不愿看你消失人海中"}
[00:34.117]Will we ever meet again?
{"我们能否再相逢"}
[00:35.869]I’ll anesthetize the pain
{"我会麻痹这份痛"}
[00:37.617]Please remember our summers
{"请记住我们的盛夏"}
[00:39.620]My heart is closed by duel
{"心门因决斗而紧闭"}
[00:41.620]Will I learn to love again?
{"我能否学会再爱人"}
[00:43.616]Who will walk with me in the rain?
{"谁愿陪我雨中同行"}
[00:45.618]Please remember our summers
{"请记住我们的盛夏"}
[01:18.116]Come the sun,
{"无论晴空万里"}
[01:20.116]come the rain
{"或是大雨倾盆"}
[01:22.616]and the leaves falling
{"落叶纷飞时节"}
[01:25.616]I will wait even if the seasons change
{"纵使四季轮转我仍等候"}
[01:31.918]Anxiety runs through my veins
{"焦虑在血脉里奔涌"}
[01:35.069]I’ll escape from all these chains
{"我要挣脱所有枷锁"}
[01:37.869]Say “come back”, in all the possible ways
{"用尽所有方式呼唤你归来"}
[01:46.367]I don’t want you to get lost
{"不愿看你消失人海中"}
[01:48.867]Will we ever meet again?
{"我们能否再相逢"}
[01:50.867]I’ll anesthetize the pain
{"我会麻痹这份痛"}
[01:52.867]Please remember our summers
{"请记住我们的夏天"}
[01:54.620]My heart is closed by duel
{"我的心因决斗而封闭"}
[01:56.617]Will I learn to love again?
{"我还能学会再爱吗？"}
[01:58.367]Who will walk with me in the rain?
{"谁会与我雨中同行？"}
[02:00.367]Please remember our summers
{"请记住我们的夏天"}
